('mail.test.mailHtml', 'zh-CN', '<div style="font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.6"><h2>邮件配置连通性测试</h2><p>如果你看到这封邮件，说明发信账号的配置可用：</p><ul><li>SMTP 连接与认证通过</li><li>中文主题编码正常</li><li>HTML 与纯文本正文正常</li></ul><p style="color:#888;font-size:13px">本邮件由后台「测试发送」触发。</p></div>', 200, 'mail', 'mail.test.mailHtml', 1, now(), now()),
('mail.test.mailHtml', 'en-US', '<div style="font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.6"><h2>Mail configuration connectivity test</h2><p>If you can read this email, the sending account is configured correctly:</p><ul><li>SMTP connection and authentication succeed</li><li>Non-ASCII subject encoding works</li><li>Both HTML and plain-text bodies render fine</li></ul><p style="color:#888;font-size:13px">Triggered by the &ldquo;test send&rdquo; action in the admin.</p></div>', 200, 'mail', 'mail.test.mailHtml', 1, now(), now()),
